[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Mobile app requirements
OPTIONS:
  VIEW_STYLE: Table

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @requirement

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Requirements for the Flutter app in ``mobile_app/``. Verifications live in ``docs/verifications/mobile/``.
<<<

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Connection and login

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MOB-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Configurable server
STATEMENT: >>>
The app shall have no built-in server address; the user enters the server URL in the settings.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Every household runs its own server.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MOB-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Login
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall log in with a household account; the app shall then use the token from REQ-BE-012.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-012

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MOB-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Expired session
STATEMENT: >>>
When the server rejects the token, the app shall tell the user the session has expired and let them log in again.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Agenda

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MOB-010
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Agenda views
STATEMENT: >>>
The app shall show the agenda as a planning list and as day, week and month views.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MOB-011
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Edit agenda
STATEMENT: >>>
Users with agenda manager rights shall be able to create, edit and delete agenda items, including start and end time and repeat options.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-021
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-040

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MOB-012
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Per-person visibility and colour
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to choose per person whether their agenda and tasks are shown and in which colour.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Tasks

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MOB-020
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Task views
STATEMENT: >>>
The app shall show tasks in a day view and a week view.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MOB-021
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Complete tasks
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to mark a task occurrence as done.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-032

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MOB-022
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Edit tasks
STATEMENT: >>>
Users with task manager rights shall be able to create, edit and delete tasks with title, description, icon, date and repeat options.
<<<
RELATIONS:
